			],
			"Message": "",
			"SHA": "2bbc26c2c559fc727549044d36165d4667cbd6da"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-11T14:01:05Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				691,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Add IPC handler for extension host message relay\n\nAdd a new `cocoon:extensionHostMessage` IPC handler in WindServiceHandlers that receives extension host messages from Wind and forwards them to Mountain for relaying to Cocoon.\n\nThe handler logs the message size for debugging and currently returns Ok(Value::Null) as a stub. The TODO documents that Cocoon's gRPC server must implement the ExtensionHostMessage RPC to receive and process these binary messages.\n\nThis establishes the Wind → Mountain → Cocoon communication pathway for extension host messaging.",
			"SHA": "4a2c91afcdbc9796ebbb4528a73a9ff52be975db"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-11T12:57:27Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
